{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32565","headline":"琪树下因吟六韵呈先达者 · 刘驾","name":"琪树下因吟六韵呈先达者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"举世爱嘉树，此树何人识。\n清秋远山意，偶向亭际得。\n奇柯交若鬬，珍叶密如织。\n尘中尚青葱，更想尘外色。\n所宜巢三鸟，影入瑶池碧。\n移根岂无时，一问紫烟客。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘驾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32565.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32565","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}